simdissdk provides CMake targets:

  find_package(simCore CONFIG REQUIRED)    # always available (core)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE VSI::simCore)

  find_package(simNotify CONFIG REQUIRED)  # always available (core)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE VSI::simNotify)

The following components are opt-in and are only built when the matching
feature of simdissdk is enabled (e.g. `vcpkg install simdissdk[simdata,simvis]`):

  find_package(simData CONFIG REQUIRED)    # feature: simdata
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE VSI::simData)

  find_package(simQt CONFIG REQUIRED)      # feature: simqt (also pulls qtbase, opengl)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE VSI::simQt)

  find_package(simUtil CONFIG REQUIRED)    # feature: simutil (also enables simvis)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE VSI::simUtil)

  find_package(simVis CONFIG REQUIRED)     # feature: simvis (also pulls osgearth, entt, simdata)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE VSI::simVis)
